DTEND:20261012T040000Z
UID:always-lalisa-55454@pathe.ch
DESCRIPTION:Always Lalisa is a feature-length documentary following global
  superstar LISA during a transformative year away from Blackpink\, the K-p
 op phenomenon that made her one of the world's most recognizable performer
 s. As the group pauses activities\, LISA embarks on the first true chapter
  of her solo career\, confronting the question of who she is beyond Blackp
 ink.<br/><br/>The film follows LISA as she writes\, records\, and releases
  her debut solo album\, Alter Ego\, makes her acting debut in the third se
 ason of The White Lotus\, and prepares for her first major solo performanc
 e at the 2025 Coachella Music Festival. Born and raised in Thailand\, LISA
  left home at fourteen to train in South Korea's demanding K-pop system\, 
 ultimately rising to global superstardom. But forging her own path\, parti
 cularly in the Western music market\, brings new pressures\, relentless sc
 rutiny\, and the challenge of redefining herself on her own terms.<br/><br
 />Intimate\, emotional\, and revealing\, Always Lalisa captures an artist 
 at a crossroads\, documenting a year of risk\, reinvention\, and self-disc
 overy as LISA begins to define not only her next chapter\, but the woman a
 nd artist she wants to become.
URL:https://www.pathe.ch/en/movies-events/always-lalisa-55454
END:VEVENT
